.TH ZEX-WHY 1 "2026-06-27" "zex 5.0.0" "Zainium OS"
.SH NAME
zex-why \- show which installed packages depend on a package
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zex why
.I <package>
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zex why
shows the reverse dependency graph: which currently installed packages
declare a runtime dependency on
.IR <package> .
.PP
This is useful before removing a package to understand what would break.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
    zex why libssl
    zex why musl
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zex (1),
.BR zex-depends (1),
.BR zex-remove (1)
